  "body": "A document loading for an iframe with `srcdoc` attribute doesn't go through [fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-fetch) algorithm. (That is, it uses the given value instead of fetching a resource.) So currently the selection (match) of the service worker registration for the navigation doesn't occur. \n\nIn the recent service worker f2f, it has been discussed that once the `iframe` `srcdoc` document is created, the resource requests for that document should be controlled by the containing frame's service worker. This bit should be specified.\n\nRelated issue: https://github.com/slightlyoff/ServiceWorker/issues/765\n",
